---
description: >-
  Uses numeric millisecond timestamps (dateFormat x) with task
  durations specified in milliseconds and as a fractional-second value
  (0.024s), verifying sub-second duration parsing.
---
gantt
  title A Gantt Diagram
  dateFormat x
  axisFormat %L
  section Section
  A task           :a1, 0, 30ms
  Another task     :after a1, 20ms
  section Another
  Another another task      :b1, 20, 12ms
  Another another another task     :after b1, 0.024s
